Pika just introduced AI video scenes that respond to you.

Pika Enact is a research experiment in live direction: reposition actors mid-scene with your mouse, talk to them conversationally, call “Action,” and control the camera while everything keeps playing.
 @pika_labs https://t.co/DSLZ1UE6JY

BJP releases an AI-generated video mocking Vijay’s newly formed TVK Cabinet. 

The video recreates an iconic comedy-philosophical scene featuring veteran actors Shivaji Ganesan and Nagesh, with altered dialogues taking aim at the new ministers.

@prathibhatweets takes us through the report.
